#
# Static pins of the official AppImage toolchain (STAGE-CI-APPIMAGE-TOOLCHAIN-PINNING,
# OWNER-M3-G-10, which supersedes the dynamic "latest" resolution of OWNER-M3-G-08).
#
# scripts/install_appimage_toolchain.sh reads this file, downloads each asset directly from
# its official GitHub release URL (no REST API, no cache), and fails closed unless the exact
# byte size and SHA-256 below match. The values are the owner-approved builds of
# OWNER-M3-G-03-R1 (appimagetool) and OWNER-M3-G-04-R1 (type-2 runtime).
#
# The `continuous` release assets are replaced upstream on every new build. When that
# happens the download no longer matches and the installer stops with PIN_STALE; a new pin
# requires a new owner decision and a separate gate. Never edit a value without one.
#
# Format: `<artifact>.<field>=<value>`, one per line, no spaces; `#` starts a comment line.
# Artifacts: appimagetool, runtime. Fields: repo, channel, commit, asset, size, sha256, url.
format=splogbook-appimage-toolchain-pins/1

